  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oven to 400\u00050F.",
    "Mix the chouri\u00060o and shoyu-koji in a small bowl.",
    "In a large pan, sear the pork belly and chicken breast over medium-high heat until browned.",
    "Add the garlic, ginger, and Portuguese red pepper to the pan and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cabbage to the pan and cook until slightly wilted.",
    "Add the chouri\u00060o mixture and salt to the pan, stirring to combine.",
    "Transfer the pan to the oven and bake for 15 minutes, or until the top is golden brown and the filling is hot and bubbly.",
    "Remove the pan from the oven and sprinkle with black pepper.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!",
